device_active(input_active)\n\tAudioServer.get_input_frames(AudioServer.get_input_frames_available())\n\n\tinput_active = not input_active\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nYou can run this on a web browser (make sure you accept mic permissions otherwise it won't work)\n[getinputbuffer_crash_repro.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26817901/getinputbuffer_crash_repro.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118677/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118677/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}